      "filename": "Coast Starlight in the Cuesta Hills above San Luis Obispo, 1985 - 4 Photos (30935849422).jpg",
      "title": "File:Coast Starlight in the Cuesta Hills above San Luis Obispo, 1985 - 4 Photos (30935849422).jpg",
