      "thumbUrl": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Coast_Starlight_in_the_Cuesta_Hills_above_San_Luis_Obispo%2C_1985_-_4_Photos_%2830935849422%29.jpg/960px-Coast_Starlight_in_the_Cuesta_Hills_above_San_Luis_Obispo%2C_1985_-_4_Photos_%2830935849422%29.jpg",
